n>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","individual":false},{"label":"Bound to defuss-i18n","html":"<div class=\"card p-4 grid gap-3\" id=\"ls-card\" data-i18n-component=\"ls-card\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n    <strong data-i18n-target=\"title\">Welcome back</strong>\n    <div\n      class=\"language-switcher\"\n      id=\"ls-bound\"\n      role=\"group\"\n      aria-label=\"Language\"\n      data-i18n-aria-label-en=\"Language\"\n      data-i18n-aria-label-de=\"Sprache\"\n      data-i18n-aria-label-ar=\"اللغة\"\n      data-languages=\"en de ar\"\n      data-value=\"en\"\n      data-align=\"end\"\n    ></div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground m-0\" data-i18n-target=\"body\">Pick a language - the card follows.</p>\n  <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-locale=\"en\">en</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-locale=\"de\">de</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-locale=\"ar\">ar</button>\n  </div>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"title\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\">Welcome back</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"title\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\">Willkommen zurück</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"title\" data-i18n-locale=\"ar\">مرحبًا بعودتك</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"body\" data-i18n-locale=\"en\">Pick a language - the card follows.</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"body\" data-i18n-locale=\"de\">Wähle eine Sprache - die Karte folgt.</template>\n  <template data-i18n-for=\"body\" data-i18n-locale=\"ar\">اختر لغة - تتبعها البطاقة.</template>\n</div>\n","individual":false}]
